    "type": "game",
    "name": "Victory's Grave: Outflank",
    "steam_appid": 3432830,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Victory\u2019s Grave: Outflank</i> is a team-based PvP shooter set in a post-apocalyptic, 1980s version of the Eastern European countryside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built by a team led by GWOT veterans with decades of experience in AAA game development, this shooter blends authenticity with intense, strategic gameplay. Set in a destructible environment where the battlefield evolves with the weather,\u00a0<i>Victory\u2019s Grave: Outflank</i> is easy to pick up but difficult to master.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PHASES OF COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432830/extras/d642a6ac040e5c105bb39afd7e86c59e.poster.avif?t=1755449499\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432830/extras/d642a6ac040e5c105bb39afd7e86c59e.webm?t=1755449499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432830/extras/d642a6ac040e5c105bb39afd7e86c59e.mp4?t=1755449499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for heart-pounding asymmetrical warfare. Attackers and defenders clash in unique, round-based matches where success hinges on strategy and teamwork. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin each round in a planning phase and construct defenses like foxholes, trenches, tripwires, and barricades. Time your attack to the shifting day and night cycles, variable weather, and changing seasons. Execute large-scale plans to achieve your objectives, but think fast and act quickly if you hope to survive this ever-changing combat zone.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TEAMWORK WINS BATTLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432830/extras/6d3027c1caf199f53fe94dd2cabb016a.poster.avif?t=1755449499\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432830/extras/6d3027c1caf199f53fe94dd2cabb016a.webm?t=1755449499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432830/extras/6d3027c1caf199f53fe94dd2cabb016a.mp4?t=1755449499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Individual skill shines, but teamwork dominates. With no fixed roles or classes, every decision is yours. Set up overwatch with a sniper rifle or a machine gun and coordinate a flanking maneuver. Or, lead a strike team to hit the objective under cover of night or harsh weather. You must adapt and overcome as a unit to defeat your enemy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PERSONALIZATION &amp; REPLAYABILITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch into Early Access with an arsenal of weapon packs, four unique uniform sets, and seven diverse battlefields. Each map demands a new approach to victory, while evolving combat mechanics keep your enemies guessing. Forge your team\u2019s identity and outsmart opponents in battles that reward creativity and coordination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Victory\u2019s Grave: Outflank</i> offers thrilling tactical gameplay where every decision matters. Are you ready to lead your team to victory?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Victory\u2019s Grave: Outflank</i> is a team-based PvP shooter set in a post-apocalyptic, 1980s version of the Eastern European countryside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built by a team led by GWOT veterans with decades of experience in AAA game development, this shooter blends authenticity with intense, strategic gameplay. Set in a destructible environment where the battlefield evolves with the weather,\u00a0<i>Victory\u2019s Grave: Outflank</i> is easy to pick up but difficult to master.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PHASES OF COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432830/extras/d642a6ac040e5c105bb39afd7e86c59e.poster.avif?t=1755449499\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432830/extras/d642a6ac040e5c105bb39afd7e86c59e.webm?t=1755449499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432830/extras/d642a6ac040e5c105bb39afd7e86c59e.mp4?t=1755449499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for heart-pounding asymmetrical warfare. Attackers and defenders clash in unique, round-based matches where success hinges on strategy and teamwork. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin each round in a planning phase and construct defenses like foxholes, trenches, tripwires, and barricades. Time your attack to the shifting day and night cycles, variable weather, and changing seasons. Execute large-scale plans to achieve your objectives, but think fast and act quickly if you hope to survive this ever-changing combat zone.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TEAMWORK WINS BATTLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432830/extras/6d3027c1caf199f53fe94dd2cabb016a.poster.avif?t=1755449499\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432830/extras/6d3027c1caf199f53fe94dd2cabb016a.webm?t=1755449499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432830/extras/6d3027c1caf199f53fe94dd2cabb016a.mp4?t=1755449499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Individual skill shines, but teamwork dominates. With no fixed roles or classes, every decision is yours. Set up overwatch with a sniper rifle or a machine gun and coordinate a flanking maneuver. Or, lead a strike team to hit the objective under cover of night or harsh weather. You must adapt and overcome as a unit to defeat your enemy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PERSONALIZATION &amp; REPLAYABILITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch into Early Access with an arsenal of weapon packs, four unique uniform sets, and seven diverse battlefields. Each map demands a new approach to victory, while evolving combat mechanics keep your enemies guessing. Forge your team\u2019s identity and outsmart opponents in battles that reward creativity and coordination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Victory\u2019s Grave: Outflank</i> offers thrilling tactical gameplay where every decision matters. Are you ready to lead your team to victory?</p>",
    "short_description": "Victory\u2019s Grave: Outflank is an intense team-based PvP shooter set in a post-apocalyptic version of 1980s Eastern Europe. Build defenses, unleash powerful weapons, and lead your team to victory in a chaotic, destructible battlefield!",
